[h1]Languages (语言)[/h1][url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/seedgen/README/README.html]EN/English[/url]|[url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/seedgen/README/README_ZH-CN.html]ZH-CN/简体中文[/url]
[h1]Seedgen[/h1]A client-side Fabric mod that locally generates vanilla terrain from a known world seed without asking the server to load or generate every source chunk.
Supported mods: [url=https://modrinth.com/mod/voxy]Voxy[/url], [url=https://modrinth.com/mod/xaeros-world-map]Xaero's World Map[/url], [url=https://modrinth.com/plugin/journeymap]JourneyMap[/url].
[quote]
[!IMPORTANT]
Multiplayer generation requires the exact world seed. A wrong seed produces terrain that does not match the server. Due to [url=https://bugs.mojang.com/browse/MC/issues/MC-55596]MC-55596[/url], generated features such as trees may be inconsistent with the server even when the seed is correct.
[/quote]
[h2]Commands[/h2][table]
[tbody]
[tr]
[th]Command[/th]
[th]Description[/th]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/seedgen on[/b][/td]
[td]Enable Seedgen.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/seedgen off[/b][/td]
[td]Disable Seedgen and stop the active session.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/seedgen toggle[/b][/td]
[td]Toggle Seedgen.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/seedgen status[/b][/td]
[td]Show the world, seed, radius, progress, thread usage, and result counters.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/seedgen radius[/b][/td]
[td]Show the configured radius in vanilla chunks.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/seedgen radius <radius>[/b][/td]
[td]Set the radius. Default: [b]64[/b]; minimum: [b]1[/b].[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/seedgen threads[/b][/td]
[td]Show the worker-thread count.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/seedgen threads <threads>[/b][/td]
[td]Set worker threads from [b]1[/b] to [b]256[/b]. Default: [b]32[/b].[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/seedgen progress[/b][/td]
[td]Show whether the progress boss bar is enabled.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/seedgen progress on|off|toggle[/b][/td]
[td]Control the progress boss bar. It is disabled by default.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/seedgen generateforfreecam[/b][/td]
[td]Show whether Freecam target generation is enabled.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/seedgen generateforfreecam on|off|toggle[/b][/td]
[td]Control whether to generate around the current camera. Disabled by default.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/seedgen generateforworldmapcenter[/b][/td]
[td]Show whether world-map-center target generation is enabled.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/seedgen generateforworldmapcenter on|off|toggle[/b][/td]
[td]Use the center of an open Xaero or JourneyMap full-screen map as a generation target. Disabled by default.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/seedgen seed[/b][/td]
[td]Show the effective seed for the current world.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/seedgen seed <seed>[/b][/td]
[td]Set the multiplayer seed. Hidden when the integrated server provides it.[/td]
[/tr]
[/tbody]
[/table]
[h2]Supported Versions[/h2][list]
[*]Minecraft 26.3[/*]
[*]Fabric Loader 0.19.5+[/*]
[*]Fabric API 0.160.5+[/*]
[*]Java 25[/*]
[*]Voxy (Optional)[/*]
[*]Xaero's World Map (Optional)[/*]
[*]JourneyMap (Optional)[/*]
[/list][h2]License[/h2]MIT
